  <prompt>On a new branch spike/specialist-agents-phase0 cut from current origin/master, add two read-only MCP spike tools on /mcp/legal-operations: spike_get_profile (caller to test profile) and spike_review_nda (agreement-review via IActionRunner with the profile bound as inputs), plus header-name logging and branch-only tests. The branch is never merged.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in the Spaarke BFF MCP tool host, ASP.NET Core Minimal APIs and Entra caller resolution.</role>
  <goal>Branch spike/specialist-agents-phase0 is pushed with the two tools, the test-profile files (A, B, patent A, patent B) keyed by the real systemuserids, header-name logging, and passing tests for fail-closed and profile isolation; master is unchanged.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-02, FR-03, NFR-04, NFR-05; reuse verdicts in notes/reuse-scan.md. Copy ShowDecisionsTool for the shape. IActionRunner BoundInputs overload; apply the model tier explicitly (#1934). mcp-r2 owns Api/Mcp on master; this branch never merges so it does not collide.</background>
